WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.154 --> 00:00:15.355
Mayor Bloom was in trouble.

2
00:00:19.179 --> 00:00:21.101
guys," Roxy called to her friends.

3
00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:26.646
"I'm going to um put more Car Wash signs up around town.

4
00:00:27.707 --> 00:00:28.828
We need more customers!"

5
00:00:32.468 --> 00:00:33.669
Roxy ran down the street.

6
00:00:33.689 --> 00:00:39.294
"That's strange," thought Terrell, watching her go.

7
00:00:39.314 --> 00:00:51.423
"Roxy isn't carrying any Roxy flew over to Police Headquarters Plaza.

8
00:00:52.644 --> 00:00:55.126
There was a big empty spot where the police station had been.

9
00:00:55.146 --> 00:00:57.789
"Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:58.069 --> 00:01:00.010
called Detective Smith, waving from the ground.

11
00:01:01.051 --> 00:01:01.872
Roxy flew down.

12
00:01:02.964 --> 00:01:05.165
"Mayor Bloom is in trouble," she said.

13
00:01:05.185 --> 00:01:07.146
"Oh no!"

14
00:01:07.527 --> 00:01:08.447
said Detective Smith.

15
00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:11.029
"And Police Headquarters is gone!"

16
00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:13.430
He started searching his pockets.

17
00:01:14.651 --> 00:01:15.471
Roxy smiled.

18
00:01:15.491 --> 00:01:19.914
"I don't think Police Headquarters is in your pocket, Detective."

19
00:01:21.235 --> 00:01:24.296
"Very funny," said Detective Smith with a frown.

20
00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:26.738
"I'm looking for my cell phone.

21
00:01:27.738 --> 00:01:28.559
Ah, here it is.

22
00:01:29.359 --> 00:01:30.620
Look at this picture I took."

23
00:01:31.828 --> 00:01:33.709
Detective Smith handed the phone to Roxy.

24
00:01:34.749 --> 00:01:37.150
She saw a picture of a tall, silver robot.

25
00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:42.032
"I was walking to Police Headquarters," said Detective Smith.

26
00:01:42.052 --> 00:01:44.793
"Suddenly that robot appeared.

27
00:01:45.854 --> 00:01:48.315
It sprayed a blue bubble around Police Headquarters.

28
00:01:49.415 --> 00:01:52.016
Then the bubble floated away with the whole building in it!"

29
00:01:53.537 --> 00:01:54.797
"Whoa," said Roxy.

30
00:01:54.817 --> 00:01:57.458
"This looks like the work of Dr.

31
00:01:57.759 --> 00:02:01.020
Odd." "You're right," said the detective.

32
00:02:02.072 --> 00:02:06.354
"Dr. Odd is the only villain smart enough to invent a robot like this one.

33
00:02:07.374 --> 00:02:11.076
But why did he take Police Headquarters and Mayor Bloom?"

34
00:02:11.096 --> 00:02:13.957
"I know why," said Roxy.

35
00:02:13.977 --> 00:02:16.578
"So the city can't stop Dr.

36
00:02:16.758 --> 00:02:19.740
Odd from stealing something else—like a bank."

37
00:02:23.101 --> 00:02:24.662
A shadow moved across the street.

38
00:02:25.662 --> 00:02:26.463
Roxy looked up.

39
00:02:27.523 --> 00:02:29.444
Floating overhead were more blue bubbles!

40
00:02:30.964 --> 00:02:32.345
Roxy shot into the sky.

41
00:02:34.306 --> 00:02:37.107
Using her super vision, Roxy peered into the nearest bubble.

42
00:02:39.328 --> 00:02:41.069
"That's Mayor Bloom's mansion!"

43
00:02:41.369 --> 00:02:42.029
said Roxy.

44
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.950
She struck the bubble as hard as she could.

45
00:02:45.951 --> 00:02:50.593
Boing! Roxy bounced and landed far away, in another neighborhood.

46
00:02:52.894 --> 00:02:54.414
"Ow," said Roxy.

47
00:02:55.295 --> 00:02:57.456
Then she saw blue mist and jumped to her feet.

48
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.722
A car skidded around the corner and then bloop!

49
00:03:03.443 --> 00:03:05.404
It was caught in a bubble and floated away.

50
00:03:06.344 --> 00:03:07.245
More bubbles formed.

51
00:03:07.825 --> 00:03:08.906
Bloop! Bloop!

52
00:03:09.986 --> 00:03:13.749
They carried away cars, buses, people, and all sorts of other things.

53
00:03:13.769 --> 00:03:16.590
"Uh-oh," thought Roxy.

54
00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.031
"I bet Dr.

55
00:03:18.251 --> 00:03:20.453
Odd's robot is—" Crash!

56
00:03:21.353 --> 00:03:23.534
Boom! Roxy looked up.

57
00:03:24.455 --> 00:03:25.936
The robot stomped past her.

58
00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:29.105
It stepped on a car and crushed it.

59
00:03:32.127 --> 00:03:33.668
Roxy shot toward the robot.

60
00:03:36.831 --> 00:03:39.572
But before she could reach it, the robot spun around.

61
00:03:41.294 --> 00:03:44.296
Bloop! Roxy was trapped in a bubble!
